            <title>TML Tunnel Manager v6.9.10</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 06:51:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>34</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>6.9.10</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's new in v6.9.10</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Fixed: BuyPass prompt no longer fires while the lid is closed — authentication is deferred until the lid is opened</li>
                    <li>Fixed: Tunnels that were already connecting on wake are no longer killed and restarted unnecessarily</li>
